id: 20
hanzi: 气氛
pinyin: qì fēn
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: atmosphere; ambience; mood (of a place or gathering)
  es: atmósfera; ambiente; clima (emocional o social)

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | the pervading tone, mood, or emotional climate of a place, meeting, or event | estado o tono emocional que se respira en un lugar, reunión o espectáculo | 热烈活跃的节日气氛 (a lively and warm festive atmosphere)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 除夕之夜全家人围坐在热气腾腾的火锅旁守岁，客厅里处处洋溢着团圆祥和的温馨气氛。 | Chúxī zhī yè quánjiā rén wéizuò zài rèqì-téngténg de huǒguō páng shǒusuì, kètīng lǐ chùchù yángyì zhe tuányuán xiánghé de wēnxīn qìfēn. | On New Year's Eve, the whole family gathered around the steaming hotpot to welcome the new year, the parlor brimming with a cozy atmosphere of reunion and peace. | En Nochevieja, la familia se congregó en torno al humeante caldero mongol, respirándose en la sala una atmósfera entrañable de armonía y reencuentro.
  #2 | 谈判刚开始时双方各不相让，但随着主谈代表幽默机智的开场发言，紧张压抑的会谈气氛逐渐缓和了下来。 | Tánpàn gāng kāishǐ shí shuāngfāng gèbùxiāngràng, dàn suízhe zhǔtán dàibiǎo yōumò jīzhì de kāichǎng fāyán, jǐnzhāng yāyì de huìtán qìfēn zhújiàn huǎnhé le xiàlái. | The talks began with neither side yielding an inch, but with the chief negotiator's witty remarks, the tense and oppressive atmosphere gradually thawed. | La negociación arrancó con total rigidez, pero el ingenioso discurso inaugural del mediador destensó gradualmente el agobiante clima de la sala.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  节日气氛 | festive atmosphere
  紧张气氛 | tense atmosphere
  热烈气氛 | warm / spirited ambience
  活跃气氛 | liven up the mood / atmosphere
  营造气氛 | create an atmosphere
  气氛融洽 | harmonious / congenial atmosphere

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  欢天喜地 | huān tiān xǐ dì | overjoyed; filled with exuberant rejoicing
  喜气洋洋 | xǐ qì yáng yáng | beaming with joy; cheerful holiday spirit
  剑拔弩张 | jiàn bá nǔ zhāng | swords drawn and bows bent; touch-and-go explosive tension
  和风细雨 | hé fēng xì yǔ | gentle breeze and mild rain; patient kindly persuasion

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  气 | qì | air; gas; energy; mood; spirit | aire; gas; aliento; espíritu | 气 | steam / breath | pictograph of rising clouds and curling steam | 气 (qì) | 4 | 单一结构 | Ancient pictograph of layers of vapor and steam curling upward into the sky; vital life force and atmospheric air. | Wisps of vapor and warm air (气) rising gently into the atmosphere. | Volutas de vapor y aliento cálido (气) elevándose suavemente en el aire. | 51 | ON | 氣
  氛 | fēn | atmosphere; vapor; misty haze | vaho; atmósfera; halo | 气 | steam / breath | 气 (atmospheric vapor) + 分 (divide / share) | 分 (fēn / phonetic) | 8 | 半包围结构 | Air radical 气 enclosing 分; ambient vapor and mist dividing and drifting across the environment, setting its mood. | Vapors (气) drifting and dispersing (分) to envelope an entire room in a distinct mood (氛). | Vahos etéreos (气) que se dispersan (分) impregnando el ambiente de un matiz singular (氛). | 55 | ONCSH | 氛

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Vaporous air (气) spreading across the room (氛) creates the palpable atmosphere (气氛).
  composite_memory_hook_es: El aliento invisible del aire (气) que impregna el espacio (氛) conforma la atmósfera del lugar (气氛).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: Deeply linked to traditional Chinese concept of 'Qi' (气), the intangible energetic vibe uniting people and environment.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Falling fourth tone followed by level high tone: 'qì fēn' (51-55). Strike down on 'qì', then float evenly on high 'fēn'.

traps_and_cognates:
  look_alikes[4]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,distinction_note}:
